1.1.0 2026-10-15
  - Added sub-2 to sub-9 (8 subjects, 40 recordings). They were converted from the B02-B09 .mat files
    already in sourcedata/ (SHA-256 checked against sourcedata_provenance.json) with the code that wrote
    sub-1: MOABB 1.4.3 (commit 4a34250a), BNCI2014_004 and BaseDataset.convert_to_bids(format="BDF").
    Regenerating sub-1 the same way gives 45 of its 55 files byte for byte (all BDF,
    events, channels, eeg.json and scans files); the 10 electrodes.tsv/coordsystem.json files hold
    the same template (standard_1005) positions, differing by at most 7.5 nm per coordinate
    (floating-point differences between the 2026 build machines).
  - events.tsv of the new subjects: onset set to the trigger time (MOABB epoching offset of 3.0 s removed,
    sample column adjusted), as done for sub-1 in 1.0.3.
  - participants.tsv: rows for sub-2 to sub-9. README: Deposit contents section. This CHANGES file.
  - sub-1 and sourcedata/ unchanged.
1.0.3 2026-10-08
  - events.tsv (sub-1, 5 files): onset set to the trigger time (MOABB epoching offset of 3.0 s removed;
    sample column adjusted).
1.0.2 2026-08-18
  - sourcedata/sourcedata_provenance.json: subject recorded for each source file.
1.0.1 2026-08-11
